WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:20.774
- So, basically, they're a woven material

00:00:20.774 --> 00:00:22.796
with adhesive and polymer.

00:00:22.796 --> 00:00:25.442
And when you wet it,
it attaches to the skin

00:00:25.442 --> 00:00:28.182
and you leave it on for
five to 10 minutes usually.

00:00:28.182 --> 00:00:30.197
And when you pull it off,
you'll see sort of these like

00:00:30.197 --> 00:00:34.019
stalagmite, stalactite
type things on the strip

00:00:34.019 --> 00:00:36.769
and that's actually oil from your skin

00:00:36.769 --> 00:00:40.000
that gets oxidized and
turns black in color

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:43.746
as well as bacteria,
dead skin, hair, dirt,

00:00:43.746 --> 00:00:45.749
basically anything that's on the surface

00:00:45.749 --> 00:00:47.499
just gets pulled off.

00:00:49.476 --> 00:00:52.317
A deep cleansing doesn't
happen with these strips.

00:00:52.317 --> 00:00:55.878
Although your skin may
feel cleaner, smoother,

00:00:55.878 --> 00:00:57.767
they really don't do anything

00:00:57.767 --> 00:00:59.926
to prevent you from developing blackheads.

00:00:59.926 --> 00:01:02.539
I totally get that they're satisfying,

00:01:02.539 --> 00:01:04.180
but I don't think over
long periods of time,

00:01:04.180 --> 00:01:05.590
they do much for you.

00:01:05.590 --> 00:01:06.771
Other things should be used.

00:01:06.771 --> 00:01:08.983
Retinoids and retinols and chemical peels

00:01:08.983 --> 00:01:11.607
can all be used in
conjunction with pore strips.

00:01:11.607 --> 00:01:14.159
Some people are worried that
they can break capillaries.

00:01:14.159 --> 00:01:16.970
Very rarely can it
cause significant damage

00:01:16.970 --> 00:01:18.913
although I do see patients all the time

00:01:18.913 --> 00:01:20.069
with lots of irritation,

00:01:20.069 --> 00:01:22.325
particularly if they're
using it frequently.

00:01:22.325 --> 00:01:25.217
Using pore strips responsibly
is really important.

00:01:25.217 --> 00:01:26.993
You don't want to use them
more than once a week.

00:01:26.993 --> 00:01:28.193
You want to make sure your skin is clean

00:01:28.193 --> 00:01:29.421
before you use them.

00:01:29.421 --> 00:01:30.760
You want to follow the directions.

00:01:30.760 --> 00:01:32.880
Don't leave them on for
longer than they say.

00:01:32.880 --> 00:01:35.440
Always remove the adhesive
to prevent irritation.

00:01:35.440 --> 00:01:37.734
And cleanse your face after.

00:01:37.734 --> 00:01:39.958
People who have allergies to
different cosmetic products

00:01:39.958 --> 00:01:41.586
should just be a little bit careful.

00:01:41.586 --> 00:01:44.023
Sometimes I'll tell people to
put them on their arms first

00:01:44.023 --> 00:01:45.833
just to make sure that
they aren't sensitive

00:01:45.833 --> 00:01:47.160
and then put them on the face.

00:01:47.160 --> 00:01:48.387
Although I really don't tell patients

00:01:48.387 --> 00:01:49.831
to use them necessarily,

00:01:49.831 --> 00:01:52.836
if people like them, I'm not
telling people not to use them.

00:01:52.836 --> 00:01:54.993
I mean, I totally get it, they're fun.

00:01:54.993 --> 00:01:57.076
I use them too sometimes.

